+/// Composes a contract `StateInit` from serialized `code` and `data` cells.
+///
+/// Each argument must be one single-root BOC. The result holds exactly these
+/// two cells, with no split depth, special flag or library, and can be passed
+/// as [`SendMessage::state_init`]. The message destination is not derived from
+/// it. Returns `None` when an argument or the composed `StateInit` is not a
+/// valid single-root BOC.
